    <string name="rules_title">How to play</string>
    <string name="welcome_title">Welcome. The whole game is four lines.</string>
    <string name="rules_1">Roll four pointy dice. Count the white tips up, that\'s your move.</string>
    <string name="rules_2">Tap a lit piece, tap again, off it goes.</string>
    <string name="rules_3">The middle lane is shared. Land on a rival, it goes home. Nobody gets caught on the centre rosette.</string>
    <string name="rules_4">Hit a rosette, roll again. First to walk all seven off wins.</string>
    <string name="rules_mistakes">Common slips</string>
    <string name="mistake_1">A zero isn\'t a bug. Four black tips up means no move this turn.</string>
    <string name="mistake_2">Bearing off needs the exact number. One short, you wait.</string>
    <string name="mistake_3">Don\'t just keep entering pieces. A lone piece in the middle lane gets eaten.</string>
    <string name="mistake_4">The centre rosette is safe ground. Sit there and they have to wait.</string>
